 10 00:52 subsets\n{\n  \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\n|Mondo Name | Mondo ID | Justification |\\n|--|--|--|--|\\n|cramps, familial adolescent| MONDO:0009027 | OMIM:218050 merged into [123320](https://www.omim.org/entry/123320) \\\"CREATINE PHOSPHOKINASE, ELEVATED SERUM\\\" |\\n|hereditary sensory and autonomic neuropathy type 1B|MONDO:0011961| OMIM Merged 608088\\nMOVED TO [614575](https://www.omim.org/entry/614575) \\\"CEREBELLAR ATAXIA, NEUROPATHY, AND VESTIBULAR AREFLEXIA SYNDROME\\\" |\\n| Charcot-Marie-Tooth peroneal muscular atrophy and Friedreich ataxia, combined | MONDO:0010553 | OMIM 302900 MOVED TO [302800](https://www.omim.org/entry/302800) |\\n|Usher syndrome type 1J | MONDO:0013935| OMIM 614869 MOVED TO [609439](https://www.omim.org/entry/609439) |\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\n(see justification column above)\\n\\n**Suggested term to consider**\\nMONDO:0009027 - > MONDO:0007402 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0011961  - > MONDO:0044720  (coordinate with Orphanet; UMLS CUI will likely merge in later)\\nMONDO:0010553 - > MONDO:0010549 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0013935 - > MONDO:0012273 (MedGen will keep our record IFF Mondo determines to keep this active for other sources/xrefs)\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\\n \",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach874nVLL\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"@kanems, thank you for this ticket. \\n\\nI will create PR to merge all these terms based on OMIM merges which conclude that the terms are of the same concepts. \\n\\nThanks. \",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-01T15:53:45Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9795#issuecomment-4171059915\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"[Obsolete] OMIM merges\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9795\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
